{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3c52ee1a68f3a07341ba6835abd7583460dbc40d304a3805471b17ee00077f73", "ja": "（『ハピマリ』CMの撮影は無事に終わり、\n今日は風花単独でのグラビア撮影だ）", "zh": "（『幸福婚礼』的广告顺利拍摄完毕，\n今天要拍的是风花个人的写真照。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "605f278d044c050dc5774ebde9ac7930bf97a69eca7498a58d930562fb56000a", "ja": "{$P$}さん。着替えてきました、\nあの……ど、どうですか？　ヘンじゃないですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我换好衣服了。\n请问……你、你觉得如何？会很奇怪吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b0008ab49d266f7847dce5cda24c4e0b723cfb898484ff1cda1102dff57066e9", "ja": "え？　ヘンなわけないじゃないか。\n今日もよく似合ってるよ、風花。", "zh": "咦？怎么会奇怪呢。\n今天的你也很好看喔，风花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ba387c105962eb9754f831b10b26e5251c5916069745e0f842745f8bde0b0520", "ja": "なら、いいんですけど……。\n今日は一人なせいか、落ち着かなくて。", "zh": "那就好……不晓得是不是因为\n今天只有我一个人，感觉有点紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c2944e00f165640716f57518e2906bb95a570d0ddd5e47224664aa457dd083af", "ja": "へえ、意外だな。こういうグラビア撮影、\n風花ならもう慣れたかと思ってたけど……。", "zh": "哦，真是意外，我还以为风花\n早就习惯拍这类写真照了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "22dedc6e01efb2ff0d644bbd1cfae07d93cdf885d8bed228795dfb3eef2f60f1", "ja": "み、水着は何回撮っても慣れませんからね！？\nそれに……。", "zh": "泳、泳装照不管拍过几次我都还是习惯不了喔！！\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1bc3f784eac0e4bfbdd556ebad48a5a2b0c82c7f6860b1955256173176d75400", "ja": "この衣装は、ウェディングのための\n特別な衣装ですから……想いも特別なんです。", "zh": "这套服装是为了婚礼特别准备的……\n灌注在其中的意念自然也不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8a06d9d7eb3aca2fb37224890df3ab36d4ed3463edcbaffd160c24650407c904", "ja": "なるほど。それで\nいつもより緊張しちゃってる、と……。", "zh": "原来如此，所以你才会\n比平常还来得紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bf2b7b542e42a4980281a6a465e104217c42011ecb02b173ae8725a4dcc80bf4", "ja": "はい……。やっぱり女の子にとって\nウェディングドレスは憧れの衣装だと思うんです。", "zh": "嗯……我想只要是女生，\n都会对婚纱怀有憧憬的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7340c73cc1b32465190603ee4d917939d1bc91b3fab4ffc62ed1e51e67df9d77", "ja": "だから、女の子がウェディングに夢を持って\nもらえるように、私も頑張らないとって。", "zh": "所以，为了让女生对婚礼抱有美梦，\n我也得加油才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aec7312f1b57f44790dcd57b2ea21200726890781ba2f360f6cdc1bbf276af45", "ja": "この後には、本物のウェディングドレスでの撮影も\n控えてますし、うう、大丈夫かなぁ……。", "zh": "等等还要换上真的婚纱拍照，\n呜呜，我没问题吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2817395685c61bfa1e6d7484377497933e31b353b4be38437033d34e917be25a", "ja": "あぁ、確かブライダルフェアで選んだドレスを\nそのまま着させてもらえるんだっけ。", "zh": "啊，在婚纱展上选的婚纱\n会有人直接帮忙穿上对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "07e51d5ca81960f62019c8ee182a575f622ff84893dd6060d324a923eaf191d7", "ja": "はい。まさか着られる日がこんなに早く来るなんて、\n思ってなくて、それでより緊張しちゃって……。", "zh": "嗯，我没想到自己这么快就要穿上婚纱，\n所以觉得特别紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1013_p", "source_sha256": "807d08a6ab3d71e532226947460bc90da2e275c355a0f4b4119cfdc9bf0ff771", "ja": "なるほどな……。でも、そんなに\n緊張しなくていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "原来是这样……不过，\n你其实也不用这么紧张吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2c53f3fe46256aad2ad5b5bcd24b090b60c46fd176df73a2b40f93f1386b2e23", "ja": "ドレスを選んでるときの風花、とても\n楽しそうだったぞ？", "zh": "我看风花在挑婚纱的时候，\n看起来非常开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f50e92215a4b6d9a4aafcfd818d3b61f0b99d93549b26bb8926a2f4ec06b0410", "ja": "そういえば……ドレスを選んでる時は、\n不安なことなんて全然考えてもいませんでした……。", "zh": "这么说起来……我在挑婚纱时，\n完全没在想这些会让我感到不安的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "45a56d53bbccad62012947bdb9f5ccad9537ccf1d42029ebbb04c281c0a3495d", "ja": "このドレスを着て、いつか私も大切な人と\nヴァージンロードを歩くって幸せなイメージで……。", "zh": "心中想的就只有自己某一天会穿上这件婚纱，\n跟心爱的人一同走上红毯，迈向幸福……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1017_p", "source_sha256": "31b961f3c6b9bd1d33b7e41b4d03775b516901ecf661fb0a8387c3640ff032bb", "ja": "そのイメージのまま、撮影に臨めばいいんじゃないか？\nきっとそれで、読者にも伝わると思うぞ。", "zh": "拍摄时你保持这个心境就可以了不是吗？\n我想那样一定也能让读者明白的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "227dc871423bfc287b7825882c200e49dc7f15c973a82caa30af91de7dde6c12", "ja": "そうですよね。ふふっ、{$P$}さんの\nおかげで大切なことを思い出せました。", "zh": "说得也是呢。呵呵，多亏{$P$}先生\n让我想起了宝贵的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e0153224650f15d9d3f617823ff2513d5b2f22bac66d391803c32d926900e936", "ja": "あ、もしかして、マリッジブルーって、\nこういうことなのかも！？", "zh": "啊，难道说所谓的婚前忧郁症，\n指的就是这么一回事吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0113_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e1618091aec843143467837a4e4847ac54cd0fe8b0abe574113d514ad6c97663", "ja": "うーん、それは……\nどうだろうな？", "zh": "嗯……这个嘛……\n不好说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
